    <briefdescription>
<para>Zero-Heap NTP v4 Server Protocol Engine over UDP port 123. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Implements a lightweight NTP v4 (RFC 5905) time server allowing SyntropicOS microcontrollers acting as network gateways to serve time synchronization to local network nodes using system RTC or GPS time. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
